- Rechecked pinned Java 5.5.1 behavior at `efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`: `isTopicOrGroupIllegal(null)` throws `NullPointerException`; `isSystemTopic(null)` throws until null is in the live system set, then returns true; the send-block set accepts and matches null.
